{title: Bind Us Together}
{key: D}
{x_theme: victory, praise}
{x_source: chrd:bind_us_together.chrd}

{comment: Chorus}
[D]Bind us together, Lord, Bind us together
With [A]cords that cannot be [D]broken
[D]Bind us together, Lord, Bind us together
[A]Bind us together in [D]love.

{comment: Verse 1}
[D]There is [G]only one [D]God, There is [A]only one [D]King
[D]There is [G]only one [D]body, That is [A]why we [D]sing

{comment: Verse 2}
[D]Made for the [G]glory of [D]God, Purchased by [A]His precious [D]Son
[D]Born with the [G]right to be [D]clean, For Jesus the [A]victory has [D]won

{comment: Verse 3}
[D]You are the [G]family of [D]God, You are the [A]promise di[D]vine
[D]You are God's [G]chosen de[D]sire, You are the [A]glorious new [D]wine
